    "question": "How do I check that I am connected to Pharos mainnet (chain ID)?",
    "docs": {
      "question": "How do I check that I am connected to Pharos mainnet (chain ID)?",
      "answer": "Pharos Pacific Mainnet uses **chain ID `1672`** (`0x688` in hexadecimal). Its RPC endpoint is `https://rpc.pharos.xyz`.\n\nTo verify the RPC connection, run:\n\n```bash\ncurl https://rpc.pharos.xyz \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  --data '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"eth_chainId\",\"params\":[],\"id\":1}'\n```\n\nA response containing `\"result\":\"0x688\"` confirms the mainnet chain ID. In your wallet’s network details, check that the chain ID is `1672`. See [Pacific Mainnet](https://docs.pharos.xyz/getting-started/network/pacific-mainnet).",
