      "answer": "On Pharos, use your wallet’s **Send** flow for USDC:\n\n1. Select the **Pharos network** and choose **USDC**.\n2. Enter the recipient’s address and the amount, then review and confirm.\n3. Keep **PROS** in your wallet to pay transaction fees on Pacific Mainnet.\n\nUse the right USDC token for your network: Pacific Mainnet uses `0xc879c018db60520f4355c26ed1a6d572cdac1815`; Atlantic Testnet uses `0xcfC8330f4BCAB529c625D12781b1C19466A9Fc8B`. Check the [Token Registry](https://docs.pharos.xyz/getting-started/token-registry) before sending.\n\nThis is a same-network transfer. For transfers between Pharos and another supported blockchain, see [Circle CCTP](https://docs.pharos.xyz/tooling-and-infrastructure/cross-chain/circle-cctp).",
